<title>USA: Wace U.S. unit to sell printing businesses.</title>
<headline>Wace U.S. unit to sell printing businesses.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wace USA Inc, a subsidiary of Wace Group Plc, said Thursday it intended to sell its printing businesses in Grand Rapids, Mich. and Memphis, Tenn.</p>
<p>Robert Brudzinski, president of Wace USA, said the company would tighten its focus on digital imaging after the sales.</p>
<p>The printing plant in Grand Rapids is a sheet-fed printer and the facility in Memphis is a screen printer.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
